[00:10.12]1. Life everlasting is promised.
[00:14.68]Our earthly home will endure.
[00:18.86]‘Meek ones will thrive,’ said the psalmist.
[00:23.18]This grand future is sure.
[00:27.30](Chorus)
[00:27.30]We can live forever.
[00:32.82]It’s worth all endeavor.
[00:37.54]God’s promise is faithful.
[00:41.16]His Word will come true.
[00:53.30]2. Paradise brought to perfection;
[00:57.44]All of God’s children set free.
[01:01.76]Under Jehovah’s direction,
[01:05.94]Peace on earth we will see.
[01:10.22](Chorus)
[01:10.22]We can live forever.
[01:14.88]It’s worth all endeavor.
[01:19.34]God’s promise is faithful.
[01:23.88]His Word will come true.
[01:35.58]3. Soon in the grand resurrection,
[01:40.12]Sorrow will all disappear.
[01:43.84]Showering tender affection,
[01:49.38]God will dry ev’ry tear.
[01:53.08](Chorus)
[01:53.18]We can live forever.
[01:58.56]It’s worth all endeavor.
[02:02.20]God’s promise is faithful.
[02:06.70]His Word will come true.
